@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001

### Get Director's Script for a session
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/output/sessions/959b470e-0752-4b25-b915-3004de243f8e/script

### Download output video MP4
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/output/sessions/959b470e-0752-4b25-b915-3004de243f8e/download/video

### Download Director's Script JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/output/sessions/959b470e-0752-4b25-b915-3004de243f8e/download/script

### Wipe Buffer: delete session and all blobs
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/output/sessions/959b470e-0752-4b25-b915-3004de243f8e
